Problem
Create EC2 instance datacenter-ec2 and CloudWatch alarm for CPU > 90%.

Solution
Portal Steps:

Launch EC2 datacenter-ec2 (Ubuntu 22.04, t3.micro)

Create CloudWatch Alarm datacenter-alarm:

Metric: EC2 → CPUUtilization

Statistic: Average

Period: 5 minutes

Condition: >= 90% for 1 consecutive period

Notification: datacenter-sns-topic
